/T (Assalamualaikum Warahmatullahi Wabarakatuh and Greetings, It is my great pleasure to introduce this publication, which reflects our organization's unwavering commitment to Environmental, Social, and Governance \(ESG\) principles. As we navigate an increasingly complex and rapidly evolving business landscape, ESG has become more than a framework for responsible business practices, it is a strategic pillar that drives sustainable growth, operational excellence, and long-term value creation.)
